      "writtenOn": "2025-05-28T17:58:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does this look right? AddRef and release in the lost callback?\n```\n[](WGPUDevice const*, WGPUDeviceLostReason reason, WGPUStringView message, void*,\n           void* outerDeviceParam) {\n            auto deviceWGPU \u003d reinterpret_cast\u003cDevice*\u003e(outerDeviceParam);\n            deviceWGPU-\u003eAPIAddRef();\n            // ...\n            deviceWGPU-\u003eAPIRelease();\n        }\n```",
      "parentUuid": "07e4bb58_f99de9bc",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 102,
        "startChar": 17,
        "endLine": 102,
